  notes: >-
    Cite the software via this CITATION.cff. A methods paper / preprint
    is forthcoming. Until then, please include the software version
    (liouscope.__version__) and TAXONOMY_VERSION (A1-A12-v3.1) so the
    mechanism labels are unambiguous.